s)\r\n-undo feature holding \"r\" will now remove either shape depending on what was most recently placed, regardless of which is selected! finally!\r\n\r\nfixed:\r\n\r\n-layering issue with squares always appearing on top of circles, now whatever shape was placed more recently will be \r\n-size slider was too small for a value range of 1 - 500, it is now larger and makes more sense", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:12:46Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b02136ba1595143600d00753c584b509cb430175", "message": "Update drawing1.html\n\nchanged the opacity setting from 0.00 - 1 to 0 - 1. decimals didnt seem to work with the opacity or alpha value", "created_at": "2025-10-29T15:52:14Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e936991d12499966fba103578112c0a71578bddd", "message": "Update drawing1.html\n\nchanged minimum value of brush size\r\n\r\nPlans to work on the undo feature in the future", "created_at": "2025-10-29T14:17:17Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3102db820d6496eaceb7c1bfe6a19e6f038d0685", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2025-05-23T18:31:32Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cd9a0fdb1e8cbc89cd69014b5cba90b196d84243", "message": "Update drawing1.html", "created_at": "2025-05-23T18:13:56Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fec9b23fc062f974c5ff15e5fcb92fe3b50fa330", "message": "Update style.css", "created_at": "2025-05-23T18:12:19Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a5593f6b96bbcbb5f6c1b30d6cdb9e22724e8b0a", "message": "Update index.html", "created_at": "2025-05-23T18:07:33Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "de98d161ccf28d617f580de30