t_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "88ae533743b4d7189fce56e665ebbf7d05ec7052", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2025-05-15T00:22:40Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f5318fcb12aeb31b11c13405fb21cd8e826bd18f", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nmain page updates and update to directions for drawing 1", "created_at": "2025-05-15T00:18:04Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4b2d86862d02af6a72c932c9ecde57366e62e9ab", "message": "Lazer Testing\n\nMAJOR UPDATE:\r\n\r\nLazer Testing\r\n     - Added a new website to test lazers! Should work on your phone !!", "created_at": "2025-02-07T17:35:27Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "86ca211be1379dfba1fe4ccdc37816f982284a45", "message": "Updated MIDI Visual FX Generator\n\nMIDI Visual FX Generator Major Update:\r\n\r\n     - Added Lazers/Explosions as visuals along with the particles\r\n     - Changed Particles back to circles for performance", "created_at": "2025-02-07T05:43:16Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "549eb67cd2d4b8853039e6267df628fc77d775a6", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nMIDI Visual FX Genorator:\r\n-quick fix to range counter not showing up unless the range is above 5", "created_at": "2024-11-07T16:22:50Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2f335beeee9e65f7f20031562e02e07acf191900", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nupdates to MIDI VFXP:\r\n- fixed range when fullscreen not enables\r\n- added slider to control tics between particle spawns. this is to let the user customize their experience based on their hardware\r\n\r\nupdates to Train Sim:\r\n-trees spawn slightly more left to try to fix issues that arise when playing on mobile (WIP, VERY BUGGY)", "created_at": "2024-11-05T19:41:11Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a542003e794e7c59215f638d8ef9b8eddb5a7871", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-10-31T20:18:00Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "70f099e95617407e8219ce0a96a339284d7e6e42", "message": "Update final.html\n\n-Small Fix To final.html 2nd title text\r\n\r\nView previous change log for major details:\r\n-------------------\r\nMajor Update officially introducing the limited QWERTY keyboard support for the visuals. This gives the user an option to play around before plugging in and setting up their midi controller. I have also made improvements to the usability for people with one MIDI controller as a bug fix within the midi file was only active if you changed the MIDI controllers you were going to use. This is what the fix MIDI button is for.\r\n-There is also a range feature which calculates the range of the notes being played and scatters particles across that range.\r\n-There is also a a fix the the particles that would spawn at the lowest possible note whenever any new note was pressed no matter the value\r\n-There is also much more instructions provided on screen to help users get started\r\nNext I have plans to:\r\n-make the range visible under the MIDI NOTE NUMBERS and VELOCITIES text above the visuals\r\n-create something translates MIDI note numbers onscreen into note values for the user", "created_at": "2024-10-30T19:14:43Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "088af26a3410bca8d9091a59b7bd3b83ed82057b", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nMajor Update officially introducing the limited QWERTY keyboard support for the visuals. This gives the user an option to play around before plugging in and setting up their midi controller. I have also made improvements to the usability for people with one MIDI controller as a bug fix within the midi file was only active if you changed the MIDI controllers you were going to use. This is what the fix MIDI button is for.\r\n-There is also a range feature which calculates the range of the notes being played and scatters particles across that range.\r\n-There is also a a fix the the particles that would spawn at the lowest possible note whenever any new note was pressed no matter the value\r\n-There is also much more instructions provided on screen to help users get started\r\nNext I have plans to:\r\nmake the range visible under the MIDI NOTE NUMBERS and VELOCITIES text above the visuals\r\n-create something translates MIDI note numbers onscreen into note values for the user", "created_at": "2024-10-30T18:57:19Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "07e601905fa6e28ce7c3a24621f453dff968b8b4", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-10-27T04:29:37Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "26b3d269a1cd5e714296cf4073e5af691dbc4877", "message": "Update final.js", "created_at": "2024-10-26T21:27:02Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "26cad49ccda63a4efc041e6af5e88da383d8adf6", "message": "Update final.js", "created_at": "2024-10-26T21:19:55Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0e6941488ea16feedc23de6840a7acc0ce40e9fc", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-10-26T17:55:25Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ddee438abc068353a8d8b5897e01c3cb629d610f", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-10-26T16:41:31Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "853a71dea92df14ab351abe0146873a6ebdb657a", "message": "Update final.js", "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:59:51Z", "repo": "aj", "file_sampled": 